    "Apple frameworks that are part of iOS, and Google Sign-In only if you choose Google Drive backup. None of them receives your favourites, places or trips, except your own iCloud backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rangka kerja Apple yang sebahagian daripada iOS, dan Google Sign-In hanya jika anda memilih sandaran Google Drive. Tiada satu pun menerima kegemaran, tempat atau perjalanan anda, kecuali sandaran iCloud anda sendiri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
