            "value": "End-to-end encrypted. Manotu never stores your passphrase: if you lose it, this backup can't be recovered."
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disulitkan hujung ke hujung. Manotu tidak pernah menyimpan frasa laluan anda: jika hilang, sandaran ini tidak dapat dipulihkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End-to-end encrypted: only people with the link can see your position. Gimano's server can't read it.": {
      "localizations": {
